    "approach": "The problem does not require any computation based on input. We simply store the given Celsius temperature (25.5), convert it to Kelvin by adding 273.15, round the result to one decimal place, and print both values in the required format. Since the values are constants, the algorithm runs in constant time and uses constant extra space.",
